The '''Observatory''' is a dimension in which the [[Unbound Werewolf]] resides.

==Spawning==
The player can spawn the Observatory by [[Trick Or Treating]] doors, where the user can interact with the event icon near the compass to get the exact portal location, as it's hidden in any door near the [[Mansion (Third Sea)]], [[Café]], and [[Middle Town]].

==Access==
To access the Observatory, players must first ensure that it has spawned. To insure, the screen will say ‘The beast awakens to hunt for prey’. Once confirmed, the first door leading to the structure must be activated.

==Trivia==

* After entering this place players can't exit until the boss dies or the player dies. When the boss dies players are teleported to [[Middle Town]], [[Café]] and [[Mansion (Third Sea)]].
* The real location of the Observatory is under [[Middle Town]], [[Café]] and [[Mansion (Third Sea)]].
* There is no other specific ways to reach the Observatory. Only during the trick or treat event when the Unbound Werewolf boss spawns.